WEBVTT

00:02.330 --> 00:06.150
<b>Asticassia School of Technology</b>

00:03.060 --> 00:06.150
<b>We will now begin the duel.</b>

00:06.430 --> 00:09.030
<b>The format will be serial battle.</b>

00:09.030 --> 00:12.990
<b>If any of the challengers
should defeat the Holder,</b>

00:12.990 --> 00:16.550
<b>that victor shall continue
battling subsequent challengers</b>

00:16.550 --> 00:20.840
<b>and the last pilot standing
will be the new Holder.</b>

00:21.750 --> 00:26.420
<b>This is an official duel,
approved by the Dueling Committee.</b>

00:26.700 --> 00:30.600
<b>The witness shall be me,
the head of Peil House.</b>

00:30.600 --> 00:32.800
<b>Elan Ceres at your service!</b>

00:32.800 --> 00:34.090
<b>Yeah, yeah...</b>

00:34.090 --> 00:37.390
<b>But why is Felsi Rollo
representing Jeturk House?</b>

00:37.390 --> 00:38.990
<b>She's cramping my style.</b>

00:38.990 --> 00:40.180
<b>Shut up!</b>

00:40.180 --> 00:42.600
<b>Then why are you here
for Grassley House, Renee?</b>

00:42.600 --> 00:45.230
<b>Isn't Ms. Sabina enough as your rep?!</b>

00:45.230 --> 00:48.400
<b>Our house's roster isn't as thin as yours!</b>

00:47.530 --> 00:48.760
<b>You two fangirls.</b>

00:48.400 --> 00:50.360
<b>Ours is way larger!</b>

00:48.760 --> 00:50.680
<b>Why don't you pipe down?</b>

00:50.680 --> 00:51.400
<b>What?!</b>

00:50.680 --> 00:51.400
<b>What?!</b>

00:51.400 --> 00:52.580
<b>Secelia...</b>

00:52.580 --> 00:55.820
<b>Please don't be rude to our observers.</b>

00:56.110 --> 00:57.700
<b>Let's all play nice!</b>

00:57.980 --> 01:00.490
<b>Mr. Elan has changed, hasn't he?</b>

01:00.780 --> 01:02.760
<b>I'd say he's a different person.</b>

01:05.370 --> 01:07.710
<b>Unlocking MS container.</b>

01:08.420 --> 01:11.170
<b><i>KP028, Ebony Boas...</i></b>

01:11.460 --> 01:12.880
<b><i>Azrawan, moving out!</i></b>

01:15.760 --> 01:18.590
<b>Now passing Point N 138!</b>

01:18.590 --> 01:22.950
<b>Entering tactical testing sector.
Fasten your seatbelts.</b>

01:26.050 --> 01:27.580
<b><i>Hey, Nika.</i></b>

01:27.580 --> 01:28.620
<b>Nika!</b>

01:28.620 --> 01:29.860
<b>S-Sorry!</b>

01:29.860 --> 01:31.160
<b>Opening hatch!</b>

01:31.880 --> 01:34.280
<b>Suletta, are you ready?</b>

01:34.280 --> 01:34.860
<b><i>Yes!</i></b>

01:35.220 --> 01:38.740
<b>LP041, Suletta Mercury...</b>

01:38.740 --> 01:40.880
<b>Aerial, moving out!</b>

01:45.740 --> 01:48.010
<b>Both parties, face off.</b>

01:48.710 --> 01:52.170
<b><i>Victory is never decided
by mobile suit performance, alone.</i></b>

01:52.170 --> 01:54.590
<b><i>Nor by the skill of the pilot, alone.</i></b>

01:55.050 --> 01:57.630
<b><i>The result itself is the only truth.</i></b>

01:55.050 --> 01:57.630
<b><i>The result itself is the only truth.</i></b>

01:55.550 --> 01:57.630
<b>5th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

01:57.630 --> 01:59.390
<b>Fix release.</b>

02:10.480 --> 02:13.160
<b>Your bride will be mine, Mercurian wench!</b>

02:14.690 --> 02:16.150
<b>Aerial!</b>

02:28.250 --> 02:30.310
<b><i>No damage to Aerial!</i></b>

02:30.310 --> 02:32.170
<b><i>Plenty of battery charge left!</i></b>

02:32.170 --> 02:33.670
<b>You can keep fighting!</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:36.510
<b><i>Roger. Continue to the next area.</i></b>

02:38.000 --> 02:41.270
<b><i>It's a serial battle!
Rest while you can!</i></b>

02:41.270 --> 02:41.760
<b>Right!</b>

02:41.760 --> 02:43.260
<b>Second battle.</b>

02:43.780 --> 02:47.100
<b>16th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

02:54.350 --> 02:56.570
<b>To hell with your new look!</b>

02:59.280 --> 02:59.700
<b>Everyone!</b>

03:07.240 --> 03:07.930
<b>Look at that.</b>

03:07.930 --> 03:10.160
<b>Can't they put up a fight?</b>

03:10.160 --> 03:11.790
<b>Third battle!</b>

03:10.160 --> 03:11.790
<b>8th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

03:13.490 --> 03:15.600
<b><i>Don't let her catch her breath!</i></b>

03:16.120 --> 03:18.300
<b><i>I'll at least score one hit!</i></b>

03:22.340 --> 03:23.680
<b>Damn it!</b>

03:23.680 --> 03:25.870
<b>Why does only the Mercurian...</b>

03:25.870 --> 03:27.180
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:31.330
<b>After all, she's Mistress Holder
who crushed the three top branches.</b>

03:32.280 --> 03:36.220
<b>Even so, this serial battle
is our best chance to beat her.</b>

03:34.170 --> 03:36.770
<b>10th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

03:36.770 --> 03:40.120
<b>Take advantage of the Holder's
dueling obligation, right, Rouji?</b>

03:40.120 --> 03:41.270
<b>Watch it, you!</b>

03:41.270 --> 03:41.970
<b>Haro...</b>

03:42.250 --> 03:45.000
<b>As long as there are challengers,</b>

03:45.000 --> 03:49.040
<b><i>the Holder must accept a duel
once every two weeks.</i></b>

03:49.490 --> 03:51.500
<b><i>While the Aerial was being rebuilt,</i></b>

03:51.500 --> 03:54.850
<b>five duels were postponed
by special exception.</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:56.630
<b>One to go!</b>

03:56.630 --> 03:57.890
<b><i>Enough is enough!</i></b>

03:56.630 --> 03:59.190
<b>2nd Tactical Testing Sector</b>

03:57.890 --> 04:00.340
<b>That should give
the challengers an edge, but...</b>

04:02.050 --> 04:03.380
<b>I made a promise.</b>

04:03.670 --> 04:06.180
<b>Until the day of Ms. Miorine's birthday...</b>

04:06.460 --> 04:07.720
<b>I won't lose!</b>

04:09.670 --> 04:14.790
<b>The rebuilt Aerial now surpasses
any other machine in the Benerit Group.</b>

04:19.140 --> 04:20.920
<b>That mobile suit creeps me out.</b>

04:20.920 --> 04:24.030
<b>No plans to challenge her again, Mr. Elan?</b>

04:25.010 --> 04:27.510
<b>That's up to company policy.</b>

04:30.490 --> 04:33.390
<b>I won, Ms. Miorine.</b>

06:05.890 --> 06:07.930
<b>Episode 13</b>

06:05.890 --> 06:07.930
<b>An Open Campus?</b>

06:08.280 --> 06:12.350
<b>For three days, starting tomorrow,
prospective students will visit our school.</b>

06:12.990 --> 06:15.100
<b>They'll experience mock classes
and lectures.</b>

06:15.100 --> 06:17.640
<b>Current students
will organize events, too.</b>

06:17.640 --> 06:19.810
<b>It'll be like a festival.</b>

06:19.810 --> 06:21.150
<b>Wow!</b>

06:21.520 --> 06:22.270
<b>What a joke...</b>

06:22.270 --> 06:24.960
<b>They're having fun in total ignorance.</b>

06:24.960 --> 06:26.570
<b>It's not their fault.</b>

06:26.570 --> 06:28.240
<b>They really don't know.</b>

06:28.240 --> 06:32.670
<b>All the media are reporting what happened
at Plant Quetta as an accident.</b>

06:32.670 --> 06:35.210
<b>The whole thing's been hushed up.</b>

06:35.210 --> 06:37.790
<b>If you talk about it,
you'll be expelled at once.</b>

06:37.790 --> 06:40.270
<b>We were attacked!
We can't just let it go!</b>

06:40.270 --> 06:41.920
<b>This isn't a fistfight.</b>

06:41.920 --> 06:43.770
<b>But I can never forgive them!</b>

06:43.770 --> 06:44.710
<b>It was terrorism!</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.670
<b>Chuchu, keep your voice down.</b>

06:46.670 --> 06:47.260
<b>But still...</b>

06:47.660 --> 06:50.150
<b>How long will you two be moping around?</b>

06:50.150 --> 06:51.420
<b>It's been two weeks!</b>

06:51.420 --> 06:52.530
<b>Stuff it.</b>

06:52.840 --> 06:55.770
<b>It was real combat...</b>

06:55.770 --> 06:56.890
<b>wasn't it?</b>

06:57.580 --> 07:01.040
<b>If we get... caught up in that again...</b>

07:01.730 --> 07:02.900
<b>Don't worry.</b>

07:04.000 --> 07:06.360
<b>Aerial and I are here with you.</b>

07:06.870 --> 07:08.780
<b>Ms. Suletta?</b>

07:10.400 --> 07:14.660
<b>Oh, I'd better go tend to the greenhouse.</b>

07:17.090 --> 07:19.430
<b>Suletta seems in good spirits.</b>

07:19.430 --> 07:23.750
<b>She went outside the plant
to help Miorine, didn't she?</b>

07:24.240 --> 07:26.090
<b>Most people would freak out.</b>

07:26.400 --> 07:28.920
<b>Company business is suspended, too.</b>

07:29.300 --> 07:31.520
<b>When's she coming back, huh?</b>

07:29.480 --> 07:33.300
<b>Benerit Group Front</b>

07:31.520 --> 07:33.300
<b>Our illustrious president...</b>

07:33.880 --> 07:37.180
<b>Recovery from a spinal injury
is a long-term struggle.</b>

07:37.180 --> 07:40.560
<b>You'll need rest too, Mistress Miorine.</b>

07:41.060 --> 07:42.160
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:47.100 --> 07:51.610
<b>Just how long are you going
to sleep, you lousy father?</b>

07:52.560 --> 07:54.870
<b>The crime was committed
by the Dawn of Fold.</b>

07:55.380 --> 07:57.330
<b>They're an anti-Spacian group.</b>

07:57.570 --> 08:03.400
<b>Is it true that Jeturk mobile suits
were used to carry out the attack?</b>

08:03.400 --> 08:04.670
<b>We have evidence.</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:07.330
<b>The machine is called a Desultor.</b>

08:07.330 --> 08:08.800
<b>There's no mistake.</b>

08:09.280 --> 08:12.680
<b>If your products are being
used for terrorism...</b>

08:12.680 --> 08:15.690
<b>You must not be very
careful with your customers.</b>

08:15.690 --> 08:18.710
<b>We're working to identify
the purchase route--</b>

08:17.850 --> 08:21.390
<b>At the moment,
we're discussing your culpability,</b>

08:21.390 --> 08:23.990
<b>Acting CEO, Lauda Neill...</b>

08:25.060 --> 08:27.410
<b>Shaddiq, continue.</b>

08:27.410 --> 08:28.920
<b>Besides the Desultors,</b>

08:28.920 --> 08:32.240
<b>there were two machines
with unregistered Permet ID codes.</b>

08:32.890 --> 08:36.380
<b>The GUND Format's parallel structure
was detected from both of them.</b>

08:36.860 --> 08:37.530
<b>In other words...</b>

08:38.180 --> 08:39.580
<b>Gundams.</b>

08:40.580 --> 08:45.310
<b>The heinous actions of these Earthians
have left President Delling near death</b>

08:45.310 --> 08:47.960
<b>and robbed us of our comrade Vim Jeturk.</b>

08:47.960 --> 08:50.020
<b>They cannot be forgiven.</b>

08:51.410 --> 08:55.820
<b><i>Discreetly but swiftly,
we must find those responsible</i></b>

08:55.820 --> 08:58.470
<b><i>and settle this with our own hands.</i></b>

08:58.470 --> 09:02.980
<b>This is a battle
for the dignity of the Benerit Group.</b>

09:02.980 --> 09:05.730
<b>Now is the time to join together!</b>

09:10.100 --> 09:14.400
<b>If the truth gets out,
our company's credibility will be ruined.</b>

09:14.940 --> 09:19.260
<b>You really don't know where
those two Gundams came from?</b>

09:19.260 --> 09:21.540
<b>I wouldn't lie to you, Father.</b>

09:22.570 --> 09:25.510
<b>You're not to leave the campus
until things calm down.</b>

09:25.910 --> 09:29.640
<b>You must also refrain from
taking part in duels or company business.</b>

09:30.660 --> 09:32.550
<b>Shaddiq!</b>

09:32.870 --> 09:35.270
<b>Was President Sarius angry?</b>

09:35.270 --> 09:37.980
<b>I guess I've fallen behind
in the succession race.</b>

09:37.980 --> 09:39.940
<b>You must've calculated on that.</b>

09:39.940 --> 09:41.390
<b>Well, what next?</b>

09:41.670 --> 09:43.620
<b>We'll drag my father into it.</b>

09:43.620 --> 09:44.850
<b>Into my plan, that is...</b>

09:45.140 --> 09:48.240
<b>Is that why you summoned... those two?</b>

09:50.600 --> 09:55.110
<b><i>They'll be questioning Ms. Miorine
a little longer as a person of interest.</i></b>

09:55.440 --> 09:57.980
<b><i>You won't be able
to speak to her just yet.</i></b>

09:57.980 --> 10:00.840
<b><i>I can't call you
without permission either.</i></b>

10:00.840 --> 10:03.620
<b>Do you think she's reading my emails?</b>

10:03.620 --> 10:06.300
<b>Is the incident at the plant
still bothering you?</b>

10:06.300 --> 10:07.810
<b><i>How did you know?</i></b>

10:07.810 --> 10:09.460
<b>I'm your mother.</b>

10:10.580 --> 10:11.880
<b>At that moment...</b>

10:14.590 --> 10:18.220
<b>I can't help wondering
if there was a better way.</b>

10:18.540 --> 10:21.110
<b><i>If you two hadn't gone to the rescue,</i></b>

10:21.110 --> 10:23.860
<b><i>Ms. Miorine and the President
could have been killed.</i></b>

10:24.720 --> 10:27.280
<b><i>You did the right thing, Suletta.</i></b>

10:27.930 --> 10:29.620
<b>Right...</b>

10:30.050 --> 10:33.640
<b>If you say so, Mom, then it must be true.</b>

10:33.640 --> 10:36.290
<b><i>Of course. I'm sure
she'll understand eventually.</i></b>

10:36.290 --> 10:38.490
<b>Thanks, Mom.</b>

10:40.840 --> 10:42.490
<b>Have you found their source?</b>

10:42.490 --> 10:46.500
<b>Nothing yet. I'll continue investigating.</b>

10:47.070 --> 10:49.220
<b>Thank you, Godoy.</b>

10:53.160 --> 10:54.080
<b>Ms. Nika?</b>

10:54.080 --> 10:54.790
<b>Huh?</b>

10:55.460 --> 10:58.520
<b>Oh, uh... s-sorry if I scared you.</b>

10:58.520 --> 11:00.400
<b>Not at all. What is it?</b>

11:01.080 --> 11:04.300
<b>I wanted to have a chat with Aerial.</b>

11:04.590 --> 11:07.030
<b>Maybe get some life advice...</b>

11:07.760 --> 11:10.740
<b>Too much has happened lately, right?</b>

11:10.740 --> 11:13.870
<b>What about you, Ms. Nika? Are you okay?</b>

11:15.000 --> 11:20.150
<b>Since we got back, you seem
to be lost in thought.</b>

11:20.410 --> 11:21.800
<b>Like just now.</b>

11:22.480 --> 11:25.470
<b>It's fine. Nothing important.</b>

11:25.470 --> 11:27.720
<b>Don't you... want my advice?</b>

11:29.790 --> 11:33.740
<b>I-I might not be able to help.</b>

11:34.390 --> 11:36.420
<b>But Ms. Nika, you're...</b>

11:36.670 --> 11:39.510
<b>a precious friend to me.</b>

11:41.290 --> 11:43.970
<b>You amaze me, Suletta.</b>

11:46.090 --> 11:47.780
<b>During the attack, too...</b>

11:47.780 --> 11:51.100
<b>You boarded Aerial to go help Miorine.</b>

11:51.680 --> 11:53.950
<b>I could never do something that scary.</b>

11:55.140 --> 11:59.690
<b>I couldn't... stop shaking either.</b>

11:59.690 --> 12:02.900
<b>But then, my mom was with me.</b>

12:02.900 --> 12:04.340
<b>Your mom?</b>

12:04.340 --> 12:08.430
<b>She always helps me move forward.</b>

12:08.820 --> 12:11.010
<b>Like a gentle magician.</b>

12:11.860 --> 12:15.320
<b>Run and gain one,
move forward and gain two.</b>

12:15.320 --> 12:18.120
<b>It's the motto she and I share.</b>

12:18.120 --> 12:20.710
<b>When you're afraid, Nika,
you too...</b>

12:21.250 --> 12:22.980
<b>Thanks.</b>

12:23.670 --> 12:25.550
<b>There she is!</b>

12:27.900 --> 12:30.600
<b>Found you, Big Sis!</b>

12:30.600 --> 12:33.660
<b>Uh... wh-who are you?</b>

12:34.090 --> 12:35.400
<b>I came to meet you,</b>

12:35.680 --> 12:37.330
<b>Big Sister Suletta!</b>

12:42.490 --> 12:44.200
<b>You want to join our House?</b>

12:44.200 --> 12:46.700
<b>Since we're Earthians, they sent us here.</b>

12:47.260 --> 12:50.060
<b>Norea Du Noc and Sophie Pulone...</b>

12:50.060 --> 12:51.790
<b>First-year Piloting majors.</b>

12:52.310 --> 12:55.080
<b>It's odd to transfer schools
in the middle of the term.</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:57.560
<b>Don't talk so freely
like you're one of us.</b>

12:57.560 --> 12:58.860
<b>Now that stings.</b>

12:58.860 --> 13:00.990
<b>Aren't we coworkers?</b>

13:00.990 --> 13:03.300
<b>You didn't invite me
on your plant trip, though.</b>

13:03.300 --> 13:05.880
<b>You sure do take things personally.</b>

13:06.180 --> 13:07.660
<b>What do we do, Martin?</b>

13:07.660 --> 13:10.040
<b>If they're Earthians,
they're welcome here.</b>

13:11.600 --> 13:12.930
<b>What's more...</b>

13:12.930 --> 13:15.850
<b>they've already moved in
with all their stuff.</b>

13:15.850 --> 13:17.880
<b>This is your family?</b>

13:17.880 --> 13:20.930
<b>This is my dad, this is my mom,</b>

13:20.930 --> 13:22.740
<b>and these are my little sisters.</b>

13:22.740 --> 13:25.350
<b>I actually wanted to bring more of them,</b>

13:25.350 --> 13:27.110
<b>but Norea said it was too much.</b>

13:27.700 --> 13:28.680
<b>You know...</b>

13:28.680 --> 13:31.100
<b>I had no interest in going to school,</b>

13:31.100 --> 13:33.160
<b>but I came here to be your friend.</b>

13:33.160 --> 13:35.770
<b>H-How did you know about me?</b>

13:36.330 --> 13:39.610
<b>Did you happen to see our PR video?</b>

13:39.610 --> 13:42.360
<b>Well... I guess that's it.</b>

13:43.170 --> 13:44.880
<b>So teach me all you know, okay?</b>

13:44.880 --> 13:46.840
<b>Big Sister Suletta!</b>

13:46.840 --> 13:48.450
<b>"Big Sister"?</b>

13:49.100 --> 13:51.020
<b>Y-You got it!</b>

13:51.020 --> 13:54.520
<b>Sophie, as your big sister,
I'll do my best to teach you!</b>

13:54.520 --> 13:55.630
<b>All I know!</b>

13:56.270 --> 13:57.980
<b>What's the meaning of this?</b>

13:57.980 --> 14:02.180
<b>The corporation that endorsed you
is registered within the Group,</b>

14:02.180 --> 14:04.220
<b>but it doesn't exist, does it?</b>

14:04.220 --> 14:06.560
<b>That's right. We're just like you.</b>

14:06.560 --> 14:09.240
<b>It's a dummy company
set up by the Prince.</b>

14:10.780 --> 14:12.410
<b>What's your objective?</b>

14:12.410 --> 14:14.730
<b>A go-between doesn't need to know.</b>

14:15.710 --> 14:20.920
<b>No one in Earth House, including me,
wants to be placed in any more danger.</b>

14:20.920 --> 14:22.280
<b>So please...</b>

14:22.670 --> 14:25.510
<b>You talk as if
you're a victim in all of this.</b>

14:26.340 --> 14:28.270
<b>We're grateful to you, at least.</b>

14:28.270 --> 14:32.640
<b>Thanks to your efforts, we were able
to mount an attack on Delling Rembran.</b>

14:33.350 --> 14:34.790
<b>I've heard all about you.</b>

14:34.790 --> 14:37.740
<b>You wanted to become
a bridge between Earth and space.</b>

14:37.740 --> 14:39.640
<b>What a lovely dream.</b>

14:40.230 --> 14:43.170
<b>So let's work together
to achieve our respective goals.</b>

14:43.650 --> 14:47.350
<b>That way, I guess
none of us will be exposed.</b>

15:34.410 --> 15:35.830
<b>Suletta Mercury!</b>

15:35.830 --> 15:38.360
<b>Today's the day
you finally go out with me.</b>

15:38.360 --> 15:40.120
<b>Oh, um...</b>

15:40.120 --> 15:40.850
<b>Today is...</b>

15:40.850 --> 15:41.670
<b>Big Sis!</b>

15:41.670 --> 15:42.580
<b>Over here!</b>

15:42.580 --> 15:43.120
<b>Huh?</b>

15:43.120 --> 15:44.790
<b>I wanna try that one next!</b>

15:44.790 --> 15:46.300
<b>Big Sis is coming!</b>

15:46.300 --> 15:47.950
<b>Better change my approach...</b>

15:49.470 --> 15:52.180
<b>Sorry, I should watch where I'm going.</b>

15:52.910 --> 15:55.360
<b>Shouldn't you be touring
with your friend?</b>

15:55.360 --> 15:57.580
<b>I wanted to look around on my own.</b>

15:57.890 --> 16:01.350
<b>What an inspiring campus you have.</b>

16:01.850 --> 16:04.100
<b>Clean, well-circulated air...</b>

16:04.610 --> 16:06.300
<b>A sky of vivid blue...</b>

16:06.300 --> 16:07.820
<b>Lush vegetation...</b>

16:08.260 --> 16:09.990
<b>Cheerful, smiling faces...</b>

16:11.450 --> 16:12.950
<b>It makes me sick.</b>

16:15.330 --> 16:17.270
<b>Sounds like we'll get along well.</b>

16:17.660 --> 16:18.910
<b>Huh?</b>

16:24.210 --> 16:26.460
<b>Some "go-between" I am...</b>

16:31.340 --> 16:35.260
<b>At Plant Quetta,
you saved us all from harm.</b>

16:35.510 --> 16:36.610
<b>Martin...</b>

16:36.980 --> 16:38.040
<b>Even so...</b>

16:38.040 --> 16:41.040
<b>As head of the House,
I'm responsible for everyone's safety.</b>

16:41.640 --> 16:44.190
<b>If you're hiding something, then tell me!</b>

16:45.600 --> 16:46.780
<b>It's nothing.</b>

16:46.780 --> 16:47.980
<b>Nika!</b>

16:47.980 --> 16:51.650
<b>I just didn't want to die,
so I sent a desperate SOS.</b>

16:51.990 --> 16:53.570
<b>That's all.</b>

16:57.160 --> 16:59.780
<b>Is there any point in
setting up our own booth?</b>

16:59.780 --> 17:02.650
<b>We don't have many events like this.</b>

17:02.650 --> 17:05.980
<b>It's a chance to promote
the company and make some money.</b>

17:05.980 --> 17:08.070
<b>It might cheer up some of us too, right?</b>

17:09.250 --> 17:10.380
<b>I agree!</b>

17:11.590 --> 17:15.180
<b>Hey, what are you rotten
Earthians so happy about?</b>

17:15.930 --> 17:17.600
<b>What do you want?</b>

17:17.600 --> 17:21.750
<b>So Mistress Holder doesn't need
to worry about tomorrow's Rumble Ring?</b>

17:22.430 --> 17:27.710
<b>This shoulda been a stage for Mr. Guel
to show off his super cool style!</b>

17:27.710 --> 17:29.010
<b>Better be ready!</b>

17:29.010 --> 17:32.570
<b>Our Jeturk House is gonna
smash you to pieces!</b>

17:33.280 --> 17:34.760
<b>Screw you.</b>

17:34.760 --> 17:37.360
<b>What's a Rumble Ring?</b>

17:37.660 --> 17:41.850
<b>A battle royal-style mock battle
held on the last day of the Open Campus.</b>

17:41.850 --> 17:47.170
<b>Current students can demonstrate their
skills and their company's mobile suits.</b>

17:47.170 --> 17:50.030
<b>The Holder has to participate every year.</b>

17:50.030 --> 17:50.950
<b>What?!</b>

17:50.950 --> 17:52.710
<b>Didn't we tell you?</b>

17:52.710 --> 17:55.660
<b>Have Nika show you
the video from last year.</b>

17:55.660 --> 17:58.150
<b>Speaking of which, Nika's missing again.</b>

17:58.150 --> 18:00.330
<b>I can't get hold of her either!</b>

18:00.330 --> 18:02.620
<b>I'll go find her, then.</b>

18:02.620 --> 18:04.350
<b>Now you mention it...</b>

18:04.350 --> 18:06.920
<b>the transfer students
have disappeared too.</b>

18:07.940 --> 18:10.690
<b>The Prince asked you to look into it?</b>

18:10.690 --> 18:13.780
<b>This is a Gundam in a different lineage
from the Ur or Thorn.</b>

18:13.780 --> 18:17.030
<b>If it'll be an obstacle,
we should destroy it now.</b>

18:17.030 --> 18:18.350
<b>What about you?</b>

18:18.350 --> 18:21.350
<b>Does Suletta Mercury have
what you were looking for?</b>

18:21.350 --> 18:23.790
<b>She's great! Kind, too...</b>

18:24.250 --> 18:28.540
<b>But even so, I don't feel
the same thrill I felt that day.</b>

18:30.630 --> 18:33.600
<b>Access to the GUND Format is protected.</b>

18:33.600 --> 18:34.450
<b>I can't get in.</b>

18:34.450 --> 18:36.550
<b>Get away from the Pharact!</b>

18:37.220 --> 18:39.090
<b>And not just that machine...</b>

18:39.390 --> 18:41.470
<b>Leave our school immediately!</b>

18:41.770 --> 18:44.180
<b><i>Did you find a record of
our communications or something?</i></b>

18:45.100 --> 18:46.750
<b><i>You didn't, did you?</i></b>

18:46.750 --> 18:50.450
<b><i>After all, you don't know
who we've been in contact with.</i></b>

18:50.450 --> 18:53.690
<b>Then I'll tell them about me
and the dummy companies!</b>

18:54.650 --> 18:56.400
<b>Be serious.</b>

19:03.450 --> 19:04.780
<b>Now, now...</b>

19:05.120 --> 19:07.360
<b>you wouldn't want to get in our way.</b>

19:07.360 --> 19:09.110
<b><i>Step aside, Sophie,</i></b>

19:10.170 --> 19:16.200
<b><i>However hard you try, you can't
change things on Earth by yourself. </i></b>

19:17.260 --> 19:20.090
<b><i>And yet, you still cling
to those lofty dreams...</i></b>

19:20.090 --> 19:22.800
<b>You're making light of the reality.</b>

19:23.100 --> 19:24.270
<b>I'm not making--</b>

19:24.270 --> 19:25.500
<b><i>Oh yes you are.</i></b>

19:25.500 --> 19:28.810
<b><i>That's why you always feel
like you've been cheated.</i></b>

19:29.140 --> 19:30.930
<b><i>You must have realized</i></b>

19:30.930 --> 19:35.610
<b><i>that an Earthian orphan couldn't just
go off to school without paying us back.</i></b>

19:41.280 --> 19:44.640
<b>I-I don't know what's going on,</b>

19:44.950 --> 19:47.910
<b>but please don't do anything
to hurt Ms. Nika!</b>

19:47.910 --> 19:51.860
<b>Oh, darn... We've been seen by Big Sis.</b>

19:51.860 --> 19:54.670
<b>Is that Ms. Norea in Pharact's cockpit?</b>

19:54.990 --> 19:56.210
<b>Why would you--</b>

19:59.470 --> 20:02.470
<b>Hey! You can't just kill Big Sis!</b>

20:02.470 --> 20:03.450
<b>K-Kill...?</b>

20:03.450 --> 20:07.100
<b><i>The go-between may have
blabbed about our secrets.</i></b>

20:07.770 --> 20:10.750
<b><i>Which means we should
get rid of these two right now.</i></b>

20:10.750 --> 20:12.800
<b>Suletta! Run!</b>

20:17.070 --> 20:19.390
<b>Ms. Miorine... forgive me.</b>

20:21.110 --> 20:23.560
<b>I challenge you to a duel!</b>

20:25.120 --> 20:26.270
<b>A duel?</b>

20:26.270 --> 20:27.690
<b>If I win...</b>

20:27.690 --> 20:29.790
<b>you won't lay a hand on Ms. Nika!</b>

20:29.790 --> 20:31.270
<b>Are you stupid?</b>

20:31.270 --> 20:33.610
<b>We have no reason to agree--</b>

20:33.610 --> 20:34.400
<b>Yes, you do!</b>

20:34.920 --> 20:36.990
<b>As long as you're students here...</b>

20:38.290 --> 20:40.300
<b>then please follow the school rules!</b>

20:40.300 --> 20:41.830
<b>Suletta...</b>

20:43.640 --> 20:47.160
<b>Your duels are just a game
where no one dies, right?</b>

20:47.160 --> 20:50.100
<b>Mobile suits are tools for killing people.</b>

20:50.440 --> 20:51.790
<b>That's not true!</b>

20:51.790 --> 20:55.480
<b>Gundams will be used
to save lives through medicine!</b>

20:57.020 --> 20:59.730
<b>As you wish. You'll get your duel.</b>

20:59.980 --> 21:00.860
<b>Sophie...</b>

21:00.860 --> 21:02.100
<b>Come on, let's do it!</b>

21:02.100 --> 21:04.110
<b>Our kind of duel.</b>

21:04.410 --> 21:11.150
<b>We'll show Big Sis that Gundams
are just machines made for violence.</b>

22:46.220 --> 22:47.530
<b>We both hate...</b>

22:47.970 --> 22:51.010
<b>being confined here, don't we?</b>

22:51.010 --> 22:51.910
<b>You...</b>

22:51.910 --> 22:53.960
<b>What were you thinking?</b>

22:53.960 --> 22:55.850
<b>Making your daughter
do something like that...</b>

22:56.100 --> 23:00.690
<b>But didn't that act
save the lives of you and the President?</b>

23:02.770 --> 23:05.390
<b>I'm sure Suletta was desperate.</b>

23:05.390 --> 23:08.180
<b>I can't deny that she went too far...</b>

23:08.180 --> 23:11.060
<b>but won't you be friends with her again
after all this questioning?</b>

23:12.330 --> 23:13.910
<b>No need to tell me.</b>

23:15.790 --> 23:18.610
<b>I came here today to ask you
to do me a favor.</b>

23:24.460 --> 23:26.780
<b>Quiet Zero?</b>

23:26.780 --> 23:30.470
<b>A secret project
that President Delling was pursuing.</b>

23:31.110 --> 23:36.220
<b>Using the GUND Format's network,
we'll rewrite this into a world without war.</b>

23:36.520 --> 23:38.610
<b>It's your father's greatest wish.</b>

23:38.610 --> 23:39.960
<b>"Without war..."</b>

23:39.960 --> 23:41.440
<b>What do you mean?</b>

23:42.360 --> 23:43.970
<b>Miorine Rembran,</b>

23:44.650 --> 23:49.680
<b>I'd like you
to take over the work of Quiet Zero.</b>

23:53.920 --> 24:01.960
<b>Episode 14</b>

23:54.370 --> 23:57.900
<b><i>Next time on </i>
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:58.300 --> 23:59.730
<b><i>"What They Wish For."</i></b>

24:01.960 --> 24:07.250
<b>Illustration: Ilya Kuvshinov</b>
